Vendored third-party code
================================================================================

The four packages below were copied into this repository rather than consumed as
dependencies. They retain their original copyright and are redistributed under
their original license. Their per-file headers have not been modified or removed.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
repowise
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Upstream project    repowise
  Upstream URL        https://github.com/repowise-dev/repowise
  Original license    GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0)
  Copyright           Copyright (c) 2024-2026 Raghav Chamadiya and contributors

  Vendored packages, and the RepoHIVE commit that introduced each:

    packages/ui           upstream @repowise-dev/ui
                          vendored in 9304da6, 2026-08-05
                          "feat(ui): vendor ui package and design tokens"

    packages/types        upstream @repowise-dev/types
                          vendored in be9e89c, 2026-08-05
                          "feat(types): vendor types package"

    packages/api-client   upstream repowise api client
                          vendored in 99a1375, 2026-08-05
                          "feat(api-client): vendor api-client package"

    packages/web          upstream repowise Web UI (Next.js frontend)
                          vendored in a4c36b2, 2026-08-05
                          "feat(web): vendor Next.js web application"

  Upstream commit     NOT RECORDED at vendoring time.

    The exact upstream revision these packages were taken from was not captured
    when they were copied, and it cannot be recovered from this repository. It is
    stated as unknown rather than guessed, because an incorrect provenance claim
    is worse than an absent one. Whoever performed the vendoring should replace
    this line with the upstream commit SHA.

  Modifications by the RepoHIVE authors

    The vendored packages are used as the RepoHIVE viewer and have been modified.
    Changes are confined to:

      - packages/web/src/lib/repohive/     the index -> canvas adapter and the
                                           display-label module, both written for
                                           RepoHIVE
      - packages/web/src/app/api/graph/    routes reading RepoHIVE's index/ files
      - packages/web/src/app/repos/        the three RepoHIVE surfaces
                                           (knowledge graph, flat baseline,
                                           decision audit)
      - packages/web/src/components/layout/nav-items.ts
                                           navigation gating, so only the
                                           implemented surfaces are reachable
      - packages/ui/src/zoom/              additive decision fields on the zoom
                                           node model and their rendering

    All modified files remain under AGPL-3.0. The RepoHIVE engine packages
    (packages/shared, packages/parser, packages/core) contain no vendored code
    and never import a vendored package.


