vendored. Each is distributed under its own license; see its package for the
full text.

  graphology                      MIT
  graphology-communities-louvain  MIT
  graphology-metrics              MIT
  tree-sitter-java                MIT
  web-tree-sitter                 MIT
  fast-check                      MIT   (development only)
  typescript                      Apache-2.0  (development only)

The viewer's dependency set is that of the vendored repowise packages; see
packages/web/package.json and packages/ui/package.json.
